- At least a dozen. probably.

776
00:59:42.590 --> 00:59:44.960
If not more.
With her drug arrest record

777
00:59:45.010 --> 00:59:47.660
my guess would be
she can't even remember.

778
00:59:48.070 --> 00:59:49.820
May I see that?

779
00:59:54.200 --> 00:59:56.830
So we'd need her permission. right?

780
00:59:56.880 --> 00:59:59.030
No. Michael is a ward of the state.

781
00:59:59.080 --> 01:00:02.280
Just apply and get a Judge
